      "text": "As Pearl also shows symptoms of Brief Psychotic Disorder, this study will examine her portrayals through the diagnostic criteria of Brief Psychotic Disorder, too. With Pearl’s antisocial and narcissistic personality traits, her behaviours and thoughts also suggest that she is very likely to have Brief Psychotic Disorder, especially during her mental collapse. According to the DSM-5, to diagnose Pearl with Brief Psychotic Disorder, she must have at least one of the core psychotic symptoms with a duration between one day and one month, and a return to baseline functioning. Based on the description in Criterion A, she demonstrates delusional thoughts and has hallucinations throughout the film, which indicates that she is satisfied with the diagnostic Criterion A."
