      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The chronic emotional invalidations and isolations cause Pearl to internalise her distress, which contributed to her psychotic symptoms and psychotic break under stress. She has an inability to process her distress or negative feelings, which leads to her ultimate collapse under the extreme pressure."
